ul.li:
a valid m-of-n bundle with exactly m signoffs and n-m unsigned
          eligible approver contexts, to prevent an implementation from
          silently replacing m-of-n with n-of-n;

an internally consistent bundle whose shared authorization
          instance was selected by the presenter rather than matching the
          relying party's registered instance;

ol.li:
Confirm SoD: initiator appears in no approver slot;
          approvers are pairwise distinct; the approval count satisfies
          required_approvals.

ul.li:
Changed the intended status from Informational to Standards Track;
        the wire format, canonicalization, signature inputs, and consumption
        rules are unchanged.

Clarified that a receipt can authorize and be consumed for
        capability issuance, but cannot be reused as per-operation approval;
        the capability protocol binds the full issuance-receipt digest.
